timestamp=2026-11-04T20:02:01.637Z level=INFO run=1247a727 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python -c \"\nimport pandas as pd\n\ncompanies = pd.read_csv('/app/dataset/companies.csv')\ninvoices = pd.read_csv('/app/dataset/invoices.csv')\n\n# 2029 and 6453 both have very small declared revenue and few employees,\n# but send huge payments to external buyers (total ~390k, ~373k gross)\n# These look very suspicious per point (c): 'sellers whose payments to external recipients look outsized relative to their declared business footprint.'\n\n# Also check point (b): 'companies that appear only as buyers despite having weak operating fundamentals'\nbuyers = set(invoices['buyer_id'])\nsellers = set(invoices['seller_id'])\nonly_buyers = buyers - sellers\n\n# Find only buyers in companies\ncompanies_only_buyers = companies[companies['company_id'].isin(only_buyers)]\nprint('Only buyers in companies:', len(companies_only_buyers))\nprint(companies_only_buyers.head(10))\n\" 2>&1" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
